src/core/writer.c	sift_nap(Min(ahead, 1000))	sleeps until the WAL rate allows the next page
src/core/writer.c	sift_nap(wt->delay_ms)	the cost delay of a throttled write
src/core/worker.c	sift_nap(ms)	sift_worker_nap, the sleep of a worker between two looks
